out avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Vas-y doucement sur l'endurance fondamentale sur cette sortie. Aucune fatigue ne doit être générée et les lignes droites finales ne sont là que pour garder le corps habitué à une grande amplitude de mouvement (en endurance fondamentale, tous les gestes sont \"restreints\" pour garder l'allure basse, on vient rééquilibrer ça avec les lignes droites)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_25","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":324,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":25,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":5,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":211,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":337,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1792972800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":1800},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1500,"pace":{"value":324}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":211}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}}]},{"_t":"SmartPPGSessionWithStats","name":"PERF - MID - AUTRE - SEMAINE 4 SEANCE 2","description":"Séance en 3 blocs. Les deux premiers blocs sont composés de 3 séries de 2 exercices enchainés sans pause. Le troisième bloc est composé de 2 séries de 2x2 exercices différents alternés, enchainés sans pause. Prend 1'  de récupération entre les séries des bloc 1 et 2, et 2' entre les séries du bloc 3. ","displayName":"Renforcement","coachAdvice":"Les débuts peuvent être durs, mais avec chaque séance, les exercices deviendront plus naturels, tu auras moins de courbatures (oui je sais) et tu ressentiras les bénéfices sur ta course et ta santé. C'est pour ça qu'il vaut mieux commencer doucement et tenir dans la durée que partir sur les chapeaux de roues et lâcher l'affaire.","importance":true,"trainingType":"PPG","trainingCategory":"gpp","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":3,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartPPGExercise","name":"Extension de Mollet","exerciseType":"ppg","sport":"ppg","difficulty":"intense","repeat":15,"durations":[],"gearVariation":{"difficultyAdjustedWithWeights":false,"difficultyVariations":[{"name":"Extension de Mollet à 2 pieds","description":"","variationType":"simplified","videos":[{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"LRwmfIIbjAq00CUzgNV9QJD00cjxpce6mY","format":"desktop"},{"thumbnail":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1730394699-dsc4256.png","muxPlaybackId":"wEJw8kcN6TSOZ2k7EYrOxnzFlrfkS3XX","form