endurance fondamentale. Le rythme doit être confortable. Adapte ton allure à la forme du jour pour que le ressenti de la séance reste vraiment facile.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Cette fois, c'est sûr, le footing ça doit définitivement être devenu ta sortie la plus agréable ! Avec la forme qui monte tu dois te sentir pousser des ailes lors de tes footings non ? Si c'est le cas... retiens-toi, garde cette allure lente où tu es en total contrôle, on est pile dans la bonne zone de travail !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":324,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":2,"weekDate":1795392000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":324}}]},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2SessionWithStats","sport":"trailV2","name":"EF_45+6LD","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale... voire plus lentement si tu en ressens le besoin. Les lignes droites (en option si tu te sens très fatigué(e)) sont à réaliser à une bonne allure et surtout avec une belle technique, on n'est pas sur des sprints ! Pour le temps de récupération, il est libre, prends le temps nécessaire entre 30\" et 1'.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale + Lignes droites","coachAdvice":"Ajouter des lignes droites en accélération progressive dans les footings, c'est vraiment une bonne manière d'entretenir ta vitesse, de te permettre de courir avec une belle amplitude de mouvement et de travailler à avoir une foulée efficace. En plus ça se fait assez naturellement sur des lignes droites ! Concentre-toi sur le fait de te relâcher... et le reste va suivre !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF_LD","trainingCategory":"trail_basic_endurance_with_straight_lines","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"EF_39","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Endurance Fondamentale","value":324,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","context":"pace","perception":"comfortable"},"durations":[{"value":39,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":6,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"LD","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"VO2max","value":209,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"Z5","abstract":true,"slug":"vo2max","context":"intensity","perception":"very-high"},"durations":[{"value":15,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartTrailV2Exercise","name":"Recup_Indif_0.75","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Endurance confort","value":337,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"endurance-confort","context":"pace","perception":"easy"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"terrainIncline":"indifferent","manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1795392000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionTrailV2ExpectedStats","expectedDistance":0,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2340,"pace":{"value":324}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":209}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":209}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":209}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"pace":{"value":209}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":45,"pace":{"value":337}},{"kind":"Z5","duration":15,"p